WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.870
Birthdays. Weddings. Baby showers.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:11.230
And everyone asks the same thing… so what do you actually want?

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.040
Meet GiftMe.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.770
Paste the link from any shop, or just search for what you’d love.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.710
Share one link with everyone.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:27.060
Friends chip in any amount, or reserve a gift to buy it themselves.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:31.260
The money lands straight in your bank, and you say thank you in one tap.

00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:35.879
And find your people on GiftMe, so you never miss their big day.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:40.879
GiftMe. Wishlists your friends can actually give to.

